<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;">
<strong>Help us Ace the 26<sup>th</sup> Annual </strong><strong>Champions for Play Golf Outing!</strong>
</h1>
<h3 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 18px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 17px;"><strong>June 17, 2022</strong></h3>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Join us Friday, June 17 for the 26<sup>th</sup> Annual Champions for PLAY golf outing. Proceeds from the event provide economically disadvantaged youth in central Ohio with the opportunity to participate in fee-based enrichment and sports activities through Columbus Recreation and Parks Department.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">For more information and to register, visit <a href="https://columbusrecparks.com/connect/support/championsforplay/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Champions for PLAY Golf Outing" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">ChampionsforPLAY.com</a> or contact Keiana Mitchell at <a href="mailto:kmmitchell@columbus.gov" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #003A69;">kmmitchell@columbus.gov</a>. The first ten foursomes to register will be entered to win a Columbus Recreation and Parks golf prize pack!</p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2022/02/5473807/3938520/copy-of-playgolfouting-2018-2_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="Man playin in the Champions For PLAY Golf Outing" width="570" height="280">
</td>
